submission/submission_provenance.json
submission/threshold_*.csv
submission/threshold_*.png
tmp_worker*_checkpoint/
GLM.md
wandb/

# Stray pnpm tool state in a Python repo: `package.json` holds only a
# `packageManager` pin and nothing in this project reads it. Ignored rather
# than tracked so the tree stays clean without committing tool junk.
node_modules/
pnpm-lock.yaml
package.json

# The project working agreement — a deliberately untracked LOCAL document,
# not a shipped artifact. The `.local.` filename is load-bearing: the harness
# probes AGENTS.md / CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.local.md / CLAUDE.local.md at the
# project root and points every agent (subagents included) at them, so the
# rules are auto-discovered rather than depending on a prompt mentioning them.
# Ignored so the tree stays clean while the file remains present on disk.
# Do not commit it; do not delete it.
AGENTS.local.md

# Every CSV is generated or local-only; the tree ships code, not data.
*.csv
